<title>USA: Fingerhut names vice president of finance.</title>
<headline>Fingerhut names vice president of finance.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fingerhut Cos Inc said Tuesday it named John Manning to the newly created position of vice president of finance.</p>
<p>Manning most recently was senior vice president and chief financial officer of Melville Realty Co, a subsidiary of Melville Corp.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
